# graphify exclusion rules. See AGENTS.md, section "Knowledge Graph (graphify)".
#
# `graphify update sys-src` scans only the Rust workspace, but this file lives
# at the repository root, so every pattern below is repository-relative
# (gitignore syntax; a pattern containing "/" is anchored at this file's
# directory). A .graphifyignore can only ever exclude MORE than a .gitignore,
# never re-include a path a .gitignore already dropped.

# Cargo build output (also a graphify default skip dir - kept explicit on
# purpose, so the exclusion is documented rather than implicit).
sys-src/target/

# Installer templates, icons and packaging helper scripts: release artefacts,
# not part of the architecture model, so they would only add noise and scan
# time to the graph.
sys-src/packaging/

# graphify's own output must never be ingested as source.
graphify-out/
